/api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105370","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105370","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105370.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105370.patch","merged_at":"2025-04-16T15:49:51Z"},"body":"Issue conclusion: GraphNode port connections appear misaligned when switching between vertex and fragment modes, only realigning after zoom or layout refresh.\r\n\r\nInvestigation: The root cause was due to port positions being calculated before child layouts had been finalized, resulting in inaccurate Y positions for ports. The original implementation relied on Control::position.y, which was not yet updated during the initial layout pass.\r\n\r\nExplanation: This fix computes vertical offset using titlebar and stylebox sizes instead, ensuring port alignment is correct immediately after layout, without relying on zoom-triggered re-layouts.\r\n\r\nResolves: #105232","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105370/reactions","tot